<section class="enhanced-details wrap" id="features" aria-labelledby="enhanced-details-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A closer look at this fork</p><h2 id="enhanced-details-title">What Keeper-Enhanced adds.</h2></div><p>Built on KeeperFX, this fork brings together native Mac play, tailored controls, recovery tools and community hosting. Upstream also supports controllers, multiplayer and modding.</p></div>
