    <article><span class="chapter-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Settle in on your Mac</h3><dl><div><dt>One native app</dt><dd>Universal builds for Apple Silicon and Intel, targeting macOS 13 and later.</dd></div><div><dt>Settings where you play</dt><dd>Resolution, fullscreen mode, cursor confinement and performance options live inside the game.</dd></div><div><dt>A way back</dt><dd>Unconfirmed display changes revert. Safe-start recovery helps after an interrupted launch.</dd></div></dl></article>
