    <article><span class="chapter-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Keep your dungeon safe</h3><dl><div><dt>Save recovery</dt><dd>Browse rotating backups, check compatibility and restore a suitable save into a free slot.</dd></div><div><dt>Separate content profiles</dt><dd>Give mod setups their own runtime, saves and settings while sharing imported originals.</dd></div><div><dt>Replay tools</dt><dd>Organize recordings, pause or change playback speed, bookmark moments and export copies.</dd></div></dl></article>
